!! MOZ_OA_BEGIN
!! GEOS-Chem 14.8.0 complex SOA (carbon_mod.F90): yields are mass yields x MW(parent)/MW(SOA); NO / HO2 branching as BETANO
!! terpene OH / O3 oxidation -> dummy RO2 (SRO2MT = MTPA + MTPO, SRO2LI = LIMO) that reacts with NO (high-NOx alphas) or HO2 (low-NOx alphas)
SRO2MT + NO => NO + 0.0086133 TSOA1 + 0.0816 TSOA2 + 0.0136 TSOA3 + 0.036267 TSOA0 ; 2.6e-12; 0; 350; 1;
SRO2MT + HO2 => HO2 + 0.017227 TSOA1 + 0.1632 TSOA2 + 0.0272 TSOA3 + 0.072533 TSOA0 ; 1.4e-12; 0; 700; 1;
SRO2LI + NO => NO + 0.43003 TSOA1 + 0.10644 TSOA2 + 1.2866 TSOA3 ; 2.6e-12; 0; 350; 1;
SRO2LI + HO2 => HO2 + 0.33193 TSOA1 + 0.2914 TSOA2 + 0.74057 TSOA3 ; 1.4e-12; 0; 700; 1;
!! aromatics: the SOA yields ride on the fullchem RO2 + NO / RO2 + HO2 loss reactions (GEOS-Chem: DARO2 = loss of LBRO2N / LBRO2H ...)
!! semivolatile POA oxidation (gas phase POG + OH, k = 2e-11) -> OPOA; OPOA mass = POA mass x (OM/OC 2.1 / 1.4)
SVPOA1 + OH => 1.5 OPOA1 + OH ; 2e-11; 0; 0; 1;
SVPOA2 + OH => 1.5 OPOA2 + OH ; 2e-11; 0; 0; 1;
!! MOZ_OA_END
